        "original_id": "8e869b17-405a-5e0b-9e51-26554cc1e7c5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Drake, DJ Maphorisa, Kyla, Themba Sekowe\n- Songs: \"One Dance\", \"Do You Mind\"\n- Albums: \"Views\"\n- Roles: rapper, record producer, disk jockey, singer\n- Places: Canada, South Africa, United Kingdom\n\nFacts:\n- Themba Sekowe, who was born in 1988, is a South African record producer and disk jockey known professionally as DJ Maphorisa.\n- DJ Maphorisa can sometimes feature vocals in songs.\n- Drake is a Canadian rapper.\n- \"One Dance\" is a song by Drake from his fourth studio album, \"Views\".\n- \"Views\" was released in 2016.\n- Kyla is best known for her song \"Do You Mind\".\n- \"Do You Mind\" became one of the most successful charting UK funky songs.\n- Kyla's song \"Do You Mind\" was later featured on Drake's 2016 international hit \"One Dance\".",
